# Configuration lives next to each app:
#   backend/.env.example                                 -> Docker Compose (production secrets and URLs)
#   backend/src/RepairShop.Api/appsettings.Example.json  -> every API setting (env var form: Section__Key)
#   frontend/.env.example                                -> Vite dev server (API proxy target)
#   frontend/.env.production.example                     -> frontend build (API base URL)
#
# Never commit real secrets: .env files are gitignored.
